<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has expanded its military footprint in southern Lebanon by constructing a 90km road network and new bases, including a road in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, while Hezbollah continues artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Israeli strikes have wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer, while shelling and demolitions have hit southern Lebanon. Protests against Israeli attacks on Palestine and Lebanon occurred in Sweden. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon, and there were 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9KdjFGemctUE9PelNoTXVtQVFWTU5pNG1zOTQ2N0NNeWlra0NaZnU2cHpSaU0tV1cyYmdCTnEyLWFvWUlMVWRPeEV1RWRLTTFYU1dIUGV1bVJoaGZ0d05NWnFCQWF6S0ZtS3pYaDJaWW5pWWN2NU54TU9pdUlyMzQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaama Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE55aVdRNklaVTdJS2wzOXlTeHRJc3hROFAxaDB2SEFEQzAyeFlibVAzSkVqU19ZeU10YkpncXk4VFZ3ZHM2T0VaNnlVbzNVUlVuU1kxZzlDaE1TdDNYd292VlJKc2VLcUhMNEEydXNES0JSLUNyVkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;8AM Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE5FMjhFNFRsZ3Z1ZTVjWXVzNG5hZ20tVS1XZUYwLTUtbm9TM19PdWd6ODBJdFcwMWw4eWNNNG1JMXNmbVcyTTlKVEdqRmFackotRTN4ZENheERlZnpTMy02RnVqSVFuTUpiNkZDdXln?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPcDk3TWVXcVVLWjdWS0tIY2tMa090dTNZVmcyMk8xUU10aS1pNi1HRGxpYl82YzZoeWhhbXRERG15SkRLRHhGSFFyUm9tRGNQVkRCVHlEZzRNcDZMall6UGQycGwxa3ZPM1kzenlnRjZlM3BrdjZPdVItTDdsN0thU2Z3WmVVaUl